  "prefLabel": "Inst 703.10 Permanent Foundations",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Inst 703.10 Permanent Foundations.\n\n(a) Designs for permanent foundations such as basements, crawl spaces, or load-bearing perimeter foundations shall be permitted.\n\n(b) An open porch shall not be installed over a basement or other enclosed space.\n\nSource. #14221, eff 2-25-25",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/inst100-700.html"
